I'm even feeling it in my own head.

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:57.610
I'm like talking to myself as I'm talking,

00:08:57.610 --> 00:09:00.160
I'm like, "This is remarkable,

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:02.210
this is actually remarkable."

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:06.300
What I'm talking about
