00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:08.690
The Internet has changed
the way we communicated

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:10.183
why aren't you using it?

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:12.250
Thank you very much, Mexico, see ya.

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:15.590
Like that's literally,
that's literally the talk.

