00:10:57.230 --> 00:11:00.920
When I say talk there's only
three things, it's so basic.

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:03.130
The written word,

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:04.620
audio,

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:06.140
and video.

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:08.860
It's been like this for a long time,

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:12.040
you could be in the newspaper
business, in the radio

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:15.900
