00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:29.970
our cost is now

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:32.160
an internal cost

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:33.870
not an external cost.

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:35.120
Not to mention

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:37.490
that

