If you are in the food business
and you're in the pizza

00:42:46.970 --> 00:42:49.810
business, and you're the best
at Google and you show up

00:42:49.810 --> 00:42:54.410
first, and you're posting
remarkable photo's on Instagram

00:42:54.410 --> 00:42:56.900
about your pizza and all those things,

00:42:56.900 --> 00:42:58.830
that's very very nice.

00:42:58.830 --> 00:43:03.610
However, unless you are
capable of building a brand

00:43:03.610 --> 00:43:07.787
that comes out of my mouth,
in a decade when I say,

00:43:07.787 --> 00:43:10.850
"Google, send me a pizza."

00:43:10.850 --> 00:43:12.113
You're in deep trouble,

00:43:13.330 --> 00:43:16.340
because now Google becomes the toll booth.

00:43:16.340 --> 00:43:21.340
Google decides what pizza
I'm getting, either A,

00:43:21.560 --> 00:43:24.105
the pizza company that Google owns,

00:43:24.105 --> 00:43:26.150
(audience laughing)

00:43:26.150 --> 00:43:29.910
or B, the pizza company
that spends the most money

00:43:29.910 --> 00:43:33.120
for the referral that
they won't even be able

00:43:33.120 --> 00:43:35.193
to afford based on their profit margin.

00:43:36.290 --> 00:43:40.760
It will not be me typing
in pizza and choosing,

00:43:40.760 --> 00:43:43.853
because you bought ads or
you have the best copy.

00:43:44.800 --> 00:43:49.113
Brand in a voice world
is the only thing left.

00:43:50.890 --> 00:43:53.620
If you have not started
the process of building

00:43:53.620 --> 00:43:57.283
your personal brand or the
brand of your organization,

00:43:58.540 --> 00:44:02.250
you are going to be
uncomfortably vulnerable

00:44:02.250 --> 00:44:05.090
in the next decade or two's advancements.

00:44:05.090 --> 00:44:08.430
I wanna remind this
room as a parting shot,

00:44:08.430 --> 00:44:12.270
that everything we talk about
today from smart phones,

00:44:12.270 --> 00:44:15.630
to social networks, to
Netflix, to everything,

00:44:15.630 --> 00:44:19.090
Ubers and on and on and on,
everything we talk about

00:44:19.090 --> 00:44:21.283
did not exist 15 years ago.

00:44:22.600 --> 00:44:23.703
Did not exist.

00:44:25.640 --> 00:44:28.770
If you think a lot has
happened since then to now,

00:44:28.770 --> 00:44:32.180
wait til you see what happens
over the next 15 years

00:44:32.180 --> 00:44:34.460
because the stack of technologies in place

00:44:34.460 --> 00:44:36.303
for far quicker advancement.

00:44:38.040 --> 00:44:41.420
Unless you are storytelling
and producing content

00:44:41.420 --> 00:44:45.390
that is either educational
or entertaining,

00:44:45.390 --> 00:44:49.040
either bringing people the
ability to escape their normal

00:44:49.040 --> 00:44:53.120
life, which is why they
will consume it, or educate

00:44:53.120 --> 00:44:56.870
and be a utility, you
will be squeezed out.

00:44:56.870 --> 00:44:58.300
Today,

00:44:58.300 --> 00:45:02.550
today needs to be the day
that you stop thinking

00:45:02.550 --> 00:45:06.390
about it and debating it,
today must become the day

00:45:06.390 --> 00:45:11.220
that you are in the
singular business of ideas

00:45:11.220 --> 00:45:15.113
of what you want to say
and actually making it.

00:45:16.040 --> 00:45:19.390
My friends, if you are not
putting out 10, 20, 30, 70

00:45:19.390 --> 00:45:23.170
pieces of content a day,
you have started the process

00:45:23.170 --> 00:45:25.483
to being completely irrelevant.

00:45:26.530 --> 00:45:27.761
Thank you.

00:45:27.761 --> 00:45:29.970
(audience clapping)

00:45:29.970 --> 00:45:30.803
Thank you.

00:45:32.694 --> 00:45:33.527
Thank you.

00:45:35.887 --> 00:45:36.720
Thank you.

